                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c4a5f361-ff9f-3059-a3e0-cb52c4fe2f4f",
                        "entry_id": "4d95ef60-ac7b-30ee-aecd-4d8e4767534f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Erlebnis, bei dem eine Person glaubt, dass das soeben Geschehene früher schon einmal stattgefunden habe"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e6483d4-5225-4229-b136-9139dc437751",
                                "sense_id": "c4a5f361-ff9f-3059-a3e0-cb52c4fe2f4f",
                                "text": "„Ich hatte ja von Anfang an ein Déjà-vu gehabt.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06e2176a-959c-4faa-b187-6d009368cd69",
                                "sense_id": "c4a5f361-ff9f-3059-a3e0-cb52c4fe2f4f",
                                "text": "„Für jene, die seit vielen Jahren die Ereignisse in der Ukraine verfolgen, sind sie ein Déjà-vu.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fbc2d2a3-686b-4a18-a9ab-ee07dca864a9",
                        "source_entry_id": "4d95ef60-ac7b-30ee-aecd-4d8e4767534f",
                        "source_sense_id": "c4a5f361-ff9f-3059-a3e0-cb52c4fe2f4f",
                        "source_sense_description": "Erlebnis, bei dem eine Person glaubt, dass das soeben Geschehene früher schon einmal stattgefunden habe",
                        "target_lang_word": "déjà vu",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "déjà vu",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdab65d9-348d-374d-99f2-5ab642b55790",
                                        "entry_id": "29071440-65d7-3234-ac46-3825944ab27d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The subjective, unexpected feeling of having experienced something before, especially when that is not the case."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06fb95d3-e55d-42c4-bde9-3dd7caf47b0d",
                                                "sense_id": "cdab65d9-348d-374d-99f2-5ab642b55790",
                                                "text": "Why did some déjà vus pattern or pulse at certain peak moments and not others?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adc3fe16-4086-4e3f-a12d-28d95c154651",
                                                "sense_id": "cdab65d9-348d-374d-99f2-5ab642b55790",
                                                "text": "He had to get back. Soon. All these déjà vus were killing him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78bbbcda-e3e6-4282-917f-60eeeee9c974",
                                                "sense_id": "cdab65d9-348d-374d-99f2-5ab642b55790",
                                                "text": "A few times she mentioned that she’d been having constant déjà vus. She hoped it wasn’t a symptom of a tumor or early-onset dementia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db34d080-43fa-3217-b911-5cf98492fd5b",
                                        "entry_id": "29071440-65d7-3234-ac46-3825944ab27d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Loosely or humorously, anything one has done before or is being repeated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fd1443c-46f9-4f3a-9e21-0008680f06cd",
                                                "sense_id": "db34d080-43fa-3217-b911-5cf98492fd5b",
                                                "text": "Have I done this before? Talk about déjà vu."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "déjà vu",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58268acd-50d8-3d66-8f6e-0df76a2bf952",
                                        "entry_id": "33c322fb-ccea-3899-9af0-c318aea2a16a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To experience déjà vu; to see (something) as though having seen it before."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c26fd84-6f7d-43e2-8ed7-2611483383fc",
                                                "sense_id": "58268acd-50d8-3d66-8f6e-0df76a2bf952",
                                                "text": "Trees looked familiar, moments of landscape were perfectly déjà-vued."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4978f7f1-088c-4fb4-adae-d88050d25970",
                                                "sense_id": "58268acd-50d8-3d66-8f6e-0df76a2bf952",
                                                "text": "Still deja vuing, I said, “Jinx. You owe me a Coke.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f3e9ed0d-c637-453d-8295-70d1f8e3ac85",
                        "source_entry_id": "4d95ef60-ac7b-30ee-aecd-4d8e4767534f",
                        "source_sense_id": "c4a5f361-ff9f-3059-a3e0-cb52c4fe2f4f",
                        "source_sense_description": "Erlebnis, bei dem eine Person glaubt, dass das soeben Geschehene früher schon einmal stattgefunden habe",
                        "target_lang_word": "promnesia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "promnesia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "651dfffc-53c4-38f9-b20e-72f7fcb75e00",
                                        "entry_id": "16f2273e-9c97-3806-b0b2-07f9aa6aaeb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Déjà vu, a sense of having experienced some event before due to an imagined memory."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "neologism",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f02c7fa5-c041-4411-8ef2-beebea366e4f",
                        "source_entry_id": "4d95ef60-ac7b-30ee-aecd-4d8e4767534f",
                        "source_sense_id": "c4a5f361-ff9f-3059-a3e0-cb52c4fe2f4f",
                        "source_sense_description": "Erlebnis, bei dem eine Person glaubt, dass das soeben Geschehene früher schon einmal stattgefunden habe",
                        "target_lang_word": "déjà vu",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "déjà vu",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33406cb8-dfe2-3472-9e0b-d5e594fc60e6",
                                        "entry_id": "f1504752-24e9-340b-909e-dd526d667337",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Variante orthographique de déjà-vu."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a998b5f4-2b85-4b55-822e-7ec22cc42a3c",
                                                "sense_id": "33406cb8-dfe2-3472-9e0b-d5e594fc60e6",
                                                "text": "J’avais remarqué sur mon passage, dans quelques yeux, une lueur d’attention soudaine et, çà et là, un signe amical auquel je ne répondais que gauchement, troublé que j’étais par une impression de déjà vu encore indéfinissable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f53d5a3a-14b4-49cd-9d67-832b64228541",
                                                "sense_id": "33406cb8-dfe2-3472-9e0b-d5e594fc60e6",
                                                "text": "– Tu n’as pas, quelquefois, ce que j’appellerai, sans prétention de paternité, le « sentiment de la vie close » ? Il vient une heure où chaque événement personnel tire à lui un fait du passé…\n– Ce sentiment, ce n’est rien d’autre que la sensation bien connue du « déjà vu »…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15476947-d14a-4bc6-970a-cc404a40f0d5",
                                                "sense_id": "33406cb8-dfe2-3472-9e0b-d5e594fc60e6",
                                                "text": "Alors, Gabriel Morange eut une vision fugace, un moment de vertige. C’était comme si une image ancienne ressurgissait, subitement. Un bond étourdissant en arrière. Ce sentiment de déjà vu, d’où pouvait-il bien provenir ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6c7ba5b4-2af3-4e07-8598-842b6c5eea76",
                        "source_entry_id": "4d95ef60-ac7b-30ee-aecd-4d8e4767534f",
                        "source_sense_id": "c4a5f361-ff9f-3059-a3e0-cb52c4fe2f4f",
